# Anchor gate flipped-hash fixture

## Question

Does one corrupted object hash pass the anchor gate?

## Answer

No. The first row carries one deliberately flipped hash character.

## Derivation trail

The test materializes both rows from the current repository tree, flips one character in the first object hash, and requires a named rejection.

